WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.600
[A soft woodland breeze. A small bird chirps.]

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:14.200
[A low, warm pulse beneath the birdsong.]

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.200
[The ground rumbles. Birds scatter through the canopy.]

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:27.200
[Ancient metal groans; fragments of earth tumble into the grass.]

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:32.250
[A rising thrum of engines.]

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:36.600
[A deep launch roar, receding into the sky. Leaves rush outward.]

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:42.000
[The wind settles. Distant birdsong returns.]